{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "霅溪記云此教三乘雖有菩薩大乘之名其實皆小乘耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "珍敬木叉為尸當制五根\n為檀節節支解等為忍精進禪定智慧竝各有文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開元錄云此經舊錄多在小乘今以論中解釋多約大乘\n故移於菩薩藏也今謂昇師所移未窮論意宜從古判深得經宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂從鹿苑至法華者及法華未度至涅槃者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂華嚴已來大\n機發者五十年來無非聞大"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "小機不息故常潰小"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "據羅什本傳云是脇尊者弟子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能所合名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "單從\n所聽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孤山以是我最後等二句為流通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂君王種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂淨行志\n道種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂商賈種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂農田種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三界六道是苦果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "業惑是苦因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空寂涅槃是樂果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三學八正上是樂因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "合云知無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "簿迷反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有云但標上首以攝\n餘四不合經意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云角城有三角故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大本兩譯\n南本三十六卷北本四十二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一五陰二煩惱三死四天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "𧯸帛氈褥金牀\n三種竝收財寶中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "參預增過為第十不順威\n儀為第十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音秀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有合為一而云歷敷有陰陽吉凶為二者非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有謂行法根本下無釋文止是懸科或云科上損智護者不看本論故致穿鑿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此謂無緣如經所誡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即有緣護法利生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三業已淨\n無惡可護"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有云牧人喻比丘執杖喻戒又云苗\n稼似喻五欲竝非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慎字有本作順非也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊記至此廣辨四藥不知宗故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南山戒疏釋略教偈不壞色香云喻不多求壞俗士信與此不同不煩和會"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊記以牛力喻檀越非也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論中許睡又以睡為消息與此不同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孤山指為他經者非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智論明三世間即開有情為五陰眾生耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一色四心受想行識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六塵\n五根是色意根是心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於上意根分出六識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊記以心坦然配法身者非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂未得者即他境事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂已得者即是自事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有將五眾作徒眾釋者幾許誤哉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊云自佗弟子者非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此一段經註解疏記全乖論意不足標破"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有作四念處中初念處非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有本作出\n世間門者非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從滅惡翻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從生善翻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從行翻也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滅色緣空與虗\n空相應故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "虗空無邊緣多定破捨空緣識與識法相應破"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三世之識無邊緣多定破捨識依無所有法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "厭無所有處如癡有想處如癰瘡故捨無所有處樂緣非有無想法故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有聲曰風結滯曰氣出入不盡曰喘無聲\n不滯出入俱盡曰息"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非白衣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非道人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊云\n有作屬內凡者非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此示苦果自集因也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此示滅果\n自道因也三學八正傾盡集因故云因滅不受後有故是果滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有本作佛速滅多一佛字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有將依正色心分者不看論故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
